{"seq":2,"slug":"isolation-levels","title":"隔离级别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/isolation-levels","wordCount":785,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"隔离级别\">隔离级别</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQL 标准定义了四种事务隔离级别，从低到高依次增强隔离性但降低并发性能。隔离级别的选择是正确性与性能之间的权衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离级别</th>\n<th>脏读</th>\n<th>不可重复读</th>\n<th>幻读</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>READ UNCOMMITTED</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>READ COMMITTED</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REPEATABLE READ</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SERIALIZABLE</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>✅ 表示可能发生，❌ 表示不会发生</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"read-uncommitted-读未提交\">READ UNCOMMITTED（读未提交）</h2><p>最低的隔离级别，事务可以读取其他事务尚未提交的数据（脏读）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 事务 A&#10;SET TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL READ UNCOMMITTED;&#10;BEGIN;&#10;SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE id = 1;&#10;-- 返回 1000&#10;&#10;-- 事务 B（尚未提交）&#10;BEGIN;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = 500 WHERE id = 1;&#10;&#10;-- 事务 A 再次读取&#10;SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE id = 1;&#10;-- 返回 500（脏读：读到了未提交的数据）&#10;&#10;-- 事务 B 回滚&#10;ROLLBACK;&#10;-- 事务 A 读到的 500 是无效数据\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ISOLATION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> READ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNCOMMITTED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 B（尚未提交）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 A 再次读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回 500（脏读：读到了未提交的数据）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 B 回滚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROLLBACK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 A 读到的 500 是无效数据</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实际应用中几乎不使用此级别，仅用于特殊的只读统计场景。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"read-committed-读已提交\">READ COMMITTED（读已提交）</h2><p>只能读取已提交事务的数据，避免了脏读，但同一事务内两次读取可能得到不同结果（不可重复读）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 事务 A&#10;SET TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL READ COMMITTED;&#10;BEGIN;&#10;SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE id = 1;&#10;-- 返回 1000&#10;&#10;-- 事务 B&#10;BEGIN;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = 500 WHERE id = 1;&#10;COMMIT;&#10;&#10;-- 事务 A 再次读取&#10;SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE id = 1;&#10;-- 返回 500（不可重复读：同一事务内两次读结果不同）&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ISOLATION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> READ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> COMMITTED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 A 再次读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回 500（不可重复读：同一事务内两次读结果不同）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>默认隔离级别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>READ COMMITTED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Oracle</td>\n<td>READ COMMITTED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQL Server</td>\n<td>READ COMMITTED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MySQL/InnoDB</td>\n<td>REPEATABLE READ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"repeatable-read-可重复读\">REPEATABLE READ（可重复读）</h2><p>保证同一事务内多次读取同一行的结果一致，但范围查询可能出现幻读。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 事务 A&#10;SET TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL REPEATABLE READ;&#10;BEGIN;&#10;SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders WHERE user_id = 1;&#10;-- 返回 5&#10;&#10;-- 事务 B&#10;BEGIN;&#10;INSERT INTO orders (user_id, total) VALUES (1, 99.00);&#10;COMMIT;&#10;&#10;-- 事务 A 再次查询&#10;SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders WHERE user_id = 1;&#10;-- 标准 SQL：可能返回 6（幻读）&#10;-- InnoDB：仍返回 5（通过间隙锁/MVCC 防止幻读）&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ISOLATION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REPEATABLE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> READ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders (user_id, total) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 A 再次查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 标准 SQL：可能返回 6（幻读）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- InnoDB：仍返回 5（通过间隙锁/MVCC 防止幻读）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"innodb-的-repeatable-read\">InnoDB 的 REPEATABLE READ</h3><p>MySQL InnoDB 的 REPEATABLE READ 实际上通过 MVCC + 间隙锁 解决了大部分幻读问题，比 SQL 标准更严格。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作类型</th>\n<th>InnoDB REPEATABLE READ 行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快照读（SELECT）</td>\n<td>MVCC，读取事务开始时的快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当前读（SELECT FOR UPDATE）</td>\n<td>加间隙锁，阻止其他事务插入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INSERT</td>\n<td>检查间隙锁，可能被阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"serializable-串行化\">SERIALIZABLE（串行化）</h2><p>最高隔离级别，完全避免所有并发问题，等效于事务串行执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SET TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL SERIALIZABLE;&#10;BEGIN;&#10;SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE balance &gt; 1000;&#10;-- 此查询会对满足条件的范围加锁&#10;-- 其他事务无法在此范围内插入或修改&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ISOLATION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SERIALIZABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 此查询会对满足条件的范围加锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 其他事务无法在此范围内插入或修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>数据库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>两阶段锁（2PL）</td>\n<td>读写都加锁，锁到事务结束</td>\n<td>MySQL SERIALIZABLE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSI（可串行化快照）</td>\n<td>基于 MVCC + 冲突检测</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"mvcc-多版本并发控制\">MVCC（多版本并发控制）</h2><p>MVCC 是实现隔离级别的核心技术，允许读操作不阻塞写操作、写操作不阻塞读操作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 数据行多版本&#10;        V1[&quot;版本1: balance=1000, txn_id=100&quot;]&#10;        V2[&quot;版本2: balance=500, txn_id=105&quot;]&#10;        V3[&quot;版本3: balance=800, txn_id=110&quot;]&#10;        V1 --&gt; V2 --&gt; V3&#10;    end&#10;    T1[&quot;事务 108: 看到版本1&quot;] -.-&gt; V1&#10;    T2[&quot;事务 112: 看到版本3&quot;] -.-&gt; V3\">graph TD\n    subgraph 数据行多版本\n        V1[\"版本1: balance=1000, txn_id=100\"]\n        V2[\"版本2: balance=500, txn_id=105\"]\n        V3[\"版本3: balance=800, txn_id=110\"]\n        V1 --&gt; V2 --&gt; V3\n    end\n    T1[\"事务 108: 看到版本1\"] -.-&gt; V1\n    T2[\"事务 112: 看到版本3\"] -.-&gt; V3</pre><h3 id=\"innodb-mvcc-实现\">InnoDB MVCC 实现</h3><p>每行数据包含隐藏列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隐藏列</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DB_TRX_ID</td>\n<td>最近修改该行的事务 ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DB_ROLL_PTR</td>\n<td>指向 Undo Log 中旧版本的指针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DB_ROW_ID</td>\n<td>自动生成的行 ID（无主键时）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"readview-机制\">ReadView 机制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"事务启动时创建 ReadView，包含：&#10;- creator_trx_id: 当前事务 ID&#10;- m_ids: 活跃事务 ID 列表&#10;- min_trx_id: 最小活跃事务 ID&#10;- max_trx_id: 下一个将分配的事务 ID&#10;&#10;可见性判断规则：&#10;1. 行的 trx_id &lt; min_trx_id → 可见（已提交）&#10;2. 行的 trx_id &gt;= max_trx_id → 不可见（未来事务）&#10;3. 行的 trx_id 在 m_ids 中 → 不可见（活跃未提交）&#10;4. 行的 trx_id 不在 m_ids 中 → 可见（已提交）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>事务启动时创建 ReadView，包含：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- creator_trx_id: 当前事务 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- m_ids: 活跃事务 ID 列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- min_trx_id: 最小活跃事务 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- max_trx_id: 下一个将分配的事务 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>可见性判断规则：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 行的 trx_id &#x3C; min_trx_id → 可见（已提交）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 行的 trx_id >= max_trx_id → 不可见（未来事务）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 行的 trx_id 在 m_ids 中 → 不可见（活跃未提交）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 行的 trx_id 不在 m_ids 中 → 可见（已提交）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"隔离级别与-readview\">隔离级别与 ReadView</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离级别</th>\n<th>ReadView 创建时机</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>READ COMMITTED</td>\n<td>每次 SELECT 创建新的 ReadView</td>\n<td>能看到最新提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REPEATABLE READ</td>\n<td>事务第一次 SELECT 时创建</td>\n<td>始终看到同一快照</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- PostgreSQL：查看当前隔离级别&#10;SHOW transaction_isolation;&#10;&#10;-- MySQL：查看当前隔离级别&#10;SELECT @@transaction_isolation;&#10;&#10;-- 设置会话级别隔离&#10;SET SESSION TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL REPEATABLE READ;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：查看当前隔离级别</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW transaction_isolation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL：查看当前隔离级别</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @@transaction_isolation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 设置会话级别隔离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SESSION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ISOLATION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REPEATABLE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> READ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"隔离级别选择指南\">隔离级别选择指南</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐级别</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>金融转账</td>\n<td>SERIALIZABLE</td>\n<td>绝对不能出错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电商订单</td>\n<td>REPEATABLE READ</td>\n<td>防止库存超卖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容管理</td>\n<td>READ COMMITTED</td>\n<td>允许看到最新提交的内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计报表</td>\n<td>READ COMMITTED</td>\n<td>允许近似值，追求性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置读取</td>\n<td>READ UNCOMMITTED</td>\n<td>极少使用，仅读临时数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((隔离级别))&#10;    READ UNCOMMITTED&#10;      允许脏读&#10;      几乎不用&#10;    READ COMMITTED&#10;      PostgreSQL/Oracle 默认&#10;      每次 SELECT 新快照&#10;    REPEATABLE READ&#10;      MySQL 默认&#10;      事务内快照一致&#10;      InnoDB 防幻读&#10;    SERIALIZABLE&#10;      完全串行化&#10;      SSI / 2PL&#10;    MVCC&#10;      多版本并发&#10;      ReadView 机制&#10;      读写不阻塞\">mindmap\n  root((隔离级别))\n    READ UNCOMMITTED\n      允许脏读\n      几乎不用\n    READ COMMITTED\n      PostgreSQL/Oracle 默认\n      每次 SELECT 新快照\n    REPEATABLE READ\n      MySQL 默认\n      事务内快照一致\n      InnoDB 防幻读\n    SERIALIZABLE\n      完全串行化\n      SSI / 2PL\n    MVCC\n      多版本并发\n      ReadView 机制\n      读写不阻塞</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>READ COMMITTED</strong> 是 PostgreSQL 和 Oracle 的默认级别，适合大多数 OLTP 场景。</li>\n<li><strong>REPEATABLE READ</strong> 是 MySQL 的默认级别，InnoDB 通过 MVCC + 间隙锁额外防止幻读。</li>\n<li><strong>MVCC</strong> 是现代数据库实现隔离性的核心技术，通过多版本实现读写不互相阻塞。</li>\n<li><strong>SERIALIZABLE</strong> 保证最强隔离性，但并发性能最低，仅在对数据一致性要求极高时使用。</li>\n<li>隔离级别的选择需根据<strong>业务容忍度和性能要求</strong>综合决定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"隔离级别","id":"隔离级别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"READ UNCOMMITTED（读未提交）","id":"read-uncommitted-读未提交"},{"level":2,"text":"READ COMMITTED（读已提交）","id":"read-committed-读已提交"},{"level":2,"text":"REPEATABLE READ（可重复读）","id":"repeatable-read-可重复读"},{"level":3,"text":"InnoDB 的 REPEATABLE READ","id":"innodb-的-repeatable-read"},{"level":2,"text":"SERIALIZABLE（串行化）","id":"serializable-串行化"},{"level":2,"text":"MVCC（多版本并发控制）","id":"mvcc-多版本并发控制"},{"level":3,"text":"InnoDB MVCC 实现","id":"innodb-mvcc-实现"},{"level":3,"text":"ReadView 机制","id":"readview-机制"},{"level":3,"text":"隔离级别与 ReadView","id":"隔离级别与-readview"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离级别选择指南","id":"隔离级别选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ACID 特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/acid-properties"},"next":{"title":"锁机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/locking-mechanisms"}}